## Decisions Made

- **Theme Override Strategy**: Used `:host-context([data-theme="light"])` directly in component stylesheets to guarantee fine-grained selector specificity without polluting global styles.
- **Hover Invariance**: Enforced that hovering cards in light mode always maintains a light elevated background (`#FFFFFF` / `#F8FAFC`) with accent borders instead of inverting to dark navy.

